msgid "We started with a simple question: In a world of fast fixes, who is looking out for the next twenty years?"
msgstr "We started with a simple question: In a world of fast fixes, who is looking out for the next twenty years?"

msgid "RWM EL was founded on the belief that technical skill is only half of the job. The other half is the integrity to do things right when no one is watching. In the Swedish electrical landscape, precision isn't an option—it's the foundation of every safe home."
msgstr "RWM EL was founded on the belief that technical skill is only half of the job. The other half is the integrity to do things right when no one is watching. In the Swedish electrical landscape, precision isn't an option—it's the foundation of every safe home."

msgid "What RWM EL Stands For"
msgstr "Vad RWM EL står för"

msgid "We stand for the quiet confidence that comes from knowing your infrastructure is handled by professionals who respect the craft. Our approach is methodical, Scandinavian in its simplicity, and uncompromising in its execution."
msgstr "We stand for the quiet confidence that comes from knowing your infrastructure is handled by professionals who respect the craft. Our approach is methodical, Scandinavian in its simplicity, and uncompromising in its execution."

msgid "Every wire we pull and every panel we install is a testament to our commitment to Swedish engineering excellence and local safety regulations."
msgstr "Every wire we pull and every panel we install is a testament to our commitment to Swedish engineering excellence and local safety regulations."

msgid "Electrical work is regulated in Sweden because incorrect installations are dangerous. We don't just follow the law; we champion the safety it provides."
msgstr "Electrical work is regulated in Sweden because incorrect installations are dangerous. We don't just follow the law; we champion the safety it provides."

msgid "Why We Do This"
msgstr "Varför vi gör detta"

msgid "We do this because a home should be a sanctuary, not a source of technical anxiety. We do this because we believe in the longevity of quality. When we leave a site, we leave behind more than just working lights—we leave behind the peace of mind that your family or business is protected by a system designed to endure."
msgstr "We do this because a home should be a sanctuary, not a source of technical anxiety. We do this because we believe in the longevity of quality. When we leave a site, we leave behind more than just working lights—we leave behind the peace of mind that your family or business is protected by a system designed to endure."

